abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin and Agent Skills pack for water tenure analysis on the FAO typology:
  source-cited catalogues of tenure arrangements from field and desk evidence, exhaustive desk
  assessments with the hyperresearch pipeline, recent-media scans, long-form reports organised by
  tenure type with OSCOLA or APA footnotes, and publication to a tenure map. The software and skills
  were vibe-coded: written by AI coding agents (Claude Code with Anthropic Claude models, operated as
  CRPG's agent "Mobot") under the orchestration of Mohamad Mova Al'Afghani, who set the goals, the
  method and the domain rules, and directed and reviewed the work. Treat it as research software.
